WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.721
This query uses a regular expression to check the
general shape of an email address

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:12.219
Rows that match are labeled valid shape Other rows
are labeled review

00:00:13.943 --> 00:00:19.589
The phrase valid shape is deliberate A regex can
check structure but

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:24.471
it cannot prove that the mailbox exists or that
every possible valid internet email syntax

00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:30.564
is covered Production validation rules should match
the application requirements
